><sup>&#x02212;</sup><bold><sup>1</sup>)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">a &#x000b1; sa</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">b &#x000b1; sb</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">r<sup>2</sup></td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-aci-2007-111">c</xref>t = 45</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">t = 60</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">t = 75</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(350 &#x000b1; 1) &#x000d7; 10<sup>2</sup></td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0,0024 &#x000b1; 0.0009</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.99993</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4,24</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1,48</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1,29</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-aci-2007-111"><p><sup>a</sup>&#x00394;O.D: Variation of the optic density.</p></fn><fn id="tfn2-aci-2007-111"><p><sup>b</sup>&#x00394;C: Variation of the p-nitrosodimethylaniline concentration.</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-aci-2007-111"><p><sup>c</sup>time of irradiation (t) in minutes.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-aci-2007-111" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Generation of <sup>1</sup>O2 by the compounds <bold>6</bold>&#x02013;<bold>10</bold>.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>Compounds</bold></th><th valign="top" align="left" colspan="3" rowspan="1"><sup>1</sup><bold>O</bold><sub>2</sub> &#x000b1; <bold>SD (</bold>&#x003bc;<bold>g L</bold><sup>&#x02212;</sup><bold><sup>1</sup>)</bold><hr/></th></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>t = 45</bold></th><th valign="top" align="lef